e I like the way it looks but  it's one thing then I would probably say  is a flaw of the way that this entire  thing is laid out what else is pretty  important is of course this view from  the lake which is like the biggest most  important view of the area and where you  can really see it kind of shaping up and  we have the paths over here where if you  go to this part of the park you're gonna  have to walk up to this part here and  get pretty much the best view of the  hill with the pagoda and the buildings  but if you take like the lower path we  have this big panorama over here where  you can like really turn around and see  all of the buildings this is gonna be  the future station so that's hopefully  gonna look fine in the future as well  you can have all of the buildings in one  big wide shot as well and on the other  side the first thing that I'm gonna do  in the next episode is get a building  around  as long as there's a wall with a bit of  foliage to close this off here just to  make sure that everything is balanced  that it doesn't look like we just have a  big hill here and nothing on this side  and make sure that this is one big cozy  Plaza that kind of feels like you're in  the middle of Asia and after that if  that's finished and the station is done  then the entire area is pretty much  finished and we can move on to what is  most likely going to be the next area  and which is going to be the European  part with the castle so thank you guys  for watching this episode I hope to see  you guys next time in which I'll start  working on the building here and maybe  even the station bye bye
 

